{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月10日，有媒體爆料稱，京東正在內測一款名為「京東追劇福利社」的獨立短劇產品，採用免費模式，產品介紹稱可「看劇領福利、劇中同款直接買，京東發貨」。觀察者網實測發現，該產品確為京東開發的小程序，目前處於測試階段、暫無任何形式的官宣，且暫未發現對應的電商跳轉入口。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/movie/1585924.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.212420+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:52:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_hash":"0720506e0771dea2df0e8384ee0b6828cf5aa15300deaf5dfd757cbb29bebe08","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}